  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Westminster Foundation for Democracy Grant in Aid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strong democracies are good for security, economic growth, and human development. Westminster Foundation for Democracy (WFD) is an Arm&apos;s Length Body of the FCDO. It is the UK public body dedicated to strengthening democracy around the world. Through our programmes, expertise, and international partnerships, we help solve problems of democracy so that democracies can address challenges &#x2013; from climate change to corruption. Grant in Aid funding supports democracy strengthening activity in ODA eligible countries.</narrative>
  </description>
